    "The Souvera Shield installation is incomplete – %1$d file(s) are missing on this server: %2$s – Please redeploy the complete app folder and restart PHP-FPM afterwards.": "De Souvera Shield-installatie is onvolledig – %1$d bestand(en) ontbreken op deze server: %2$s – Implementeer de volledige app-map opnieuw en herstart daarna PHP-FPM.",
